(5041309, 735841, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is the only closeup I''ve really felt said "abandoned" so far in voting. Nice job.</td>', 'This is the only closeup I''ve really felt said "abandoned" so far in voting. Nice job.', '2008-11-03 14:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
