(5041799, 735906, 58728, '<td valign="top">nice subject.  Composition is just ok for me though.  Maybe if it weren''t cropped quite as tight?</td>', 'nice subject.  Composition is just ok for me though.  Maybe if it weren''t cropped quite as tight?', '2008-11-03 16:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5041807, 735825, 63398, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty cool! 7</td>', 'That''s pretty cool! 7', '2008-11-03 16:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5041884, 736126, 72670, '<td valign="top">Nice choice. I would like to see this with different lighting or processing. Maybe a curves adjustment might give it more contrast and bring out some texture and the browns. No vote just comments</td>', 'Nice choice. I would like to see this with different lighting or processing. Maybe a curves adjustment might give it more contrast and bring out some texture and the browns. No vote just comments', '2008-11-03 17:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5041885, 735857, 72670, '<td valign="top">Interesting ice formation. Your DOF is  a little too shallow for me. I would have liked to see all the ice in focus. No vote just comments</td>', 'Interesting ice formation. Your DOF is  a little too shallow for me. I would have liked to see all the ice in focus. No vote just comments', '2008-11-03 17:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5041929, 735078, 98948, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors and the soft light in this photo. Creative, nicely composed; very nice picture. Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'I really like the colors and the soft light in this photo. Creative, nicely composed; very nice picture. Thanks for sharing.', '2008-11-03 17:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5041940, 736081, 20577, '<td valign="top">This really reminds of something, but I can''t really put a finger on it. It''s driving me NUTS!</td>', 'This really reminds of something, but I can''t really put a finger on it. It''s driving me NUTS!', '2008-11-03 18:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5041944, 735965, 98948, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and shadows here. Interesting photo... makes me want to know more about the boat.</td>', 'I like the lighting and shadows here. Interesting photo... makes me want to know more about the boat.', '2008-11-03 18:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5041945, 734503, 68887, '<td valign="top">too much hdr for me.. nice shot anyway</td>', 'too much hdr for me.. nice shot anyway', '2008-11-03 18:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5041949, 734924, 68887, '<td valign="top">does not seem abandoned..</td>', 'does not seem abandoned..', '2008-11-03 18:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5041950, 736027, 98948, '<td valign="top">I like what you''ve done with the color. The shadows, lighting, and depth are great. I think the only change I would suggest is the really dark area towards the back (right of center), maybe bring out a little detail there. Just my opinion though. I really like the feel of this picture.</td>', 'I like what you''ve done with the color. The shadows, lighting, and depth are great. I think the only change I would suggest is the really dark area towards the back (right of center), maybe bring out a little detail there. Just my opinion though. I really like the feel of this picture.', '2008-11-03 18:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5041956, 735985, 98948, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. I like the blackness of the room in contrast to the illumination of the cat. And his glowing eyes really grab the attention.</td>', 'Nice lighting. I like the blackness of the room in contrast to the illumination of the cat. And his glowing eyes really grab the attention.', '2008-11-03 18:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5041968, 735794, 72670, '<td valign="top">This almost has an impressionistic feel. Not sure if thats on purpose or just out of focus. No vote just comments</td>', 'This almost has an impressionistic feel. Not sure if thats on purpose or just out of focus. No vote just comments', '2008-11-03 18:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5041973, 735951, 72670, '<td valign="top">Good subject. It looks a Little flat.I would have liked to se this same shot taken at prime light hours. Dawn or dusk. No vote just comments</td>', 'Good subject. It looks a Little flat.I would have liked to se this same shot taken at prime light hours. Dawn or dusk. No vote just comments', '2008-11-03 18:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5041974, 734489, 98948, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic. I like the clouds and the overall lighting. The awning jutting out really give it depth. Nice job.</td>', 'Very dramatic. I like the clouds and the overall lighting. The awning jutting out really give it depth. Nice job.', '2008-11-03 18:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5041977, 736123, 72670, '<td valign="top">Great perspective, Nice sky, good contrast and nice processing. It looks too new for an abandoned feel. No vote just comments</td>', 'Great perspective, Nice sky, good contrast and nice processing. It looks too new for an abandoned feel. No vote just comments', '2008-11-03 18:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5041978, 735857, 98948, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful, but what is it?</td>', 'This is beautiful, but what is it?', '2008-11-03 18:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5041986, 736027, 72670, '<td valign="top">I like the place you have chosen but the girl and the outfit and her placement just ruins it for me. I would have left her out. I am a big fan of adding a human element to certain photos, in this case not so much. No vote just comments</td>', 'I like the place you have chosen but the girl and the outfit and her placement just ruins it for me. I would have left her out. I am a big fan of adding a human element to certain photos, in this case not so much. No vote just comments', '2008-11-03 18:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
