(5043987, 735555, 45475, '<td valign="top">This sort of location is many a photographer''s dream. I''m not sure it''s all it can be from the position you''ve taken the shot. You may want to try getting down there and shooting from a lower perspective. Or even wait a little while longer for the tide to come in and see what happens around those poles...</td>', 'This sort of location is many a photographer''s dream. I''m not sure it''s all it can be from the position you''ve taken the shot. You may want to try getting down there and shooting from a lower perspective. Or even wait a little while longer for the tide to come in and see what happens around those poles...', '2008-11-04 19:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
