(5044288, 735723, 68947, '<td valign="top">Really nicely photographed, very nicely edited.  A bit of a tight crop but, the angle of the cottage/home is quite nice.  In looking at this shot more closely...LOL....something tells me that it''s not quite abandoned with the satelite dish and the newer umbrella by the side.  If someone is "gone"...they''re likely returning. *wink*</td>', 'Really nicely photographed, very nicely edited.  A bit of a tight crop but, the angle of the cottage/home is quite nice.  In looking at this shot more closely...LOL....something tells me that it''s not quite abandoned with the satelite dish and the newer umbrella by the side.  If someone is "gone"...they''re likely returning. *wink*', '2008-11-04 21:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044291, 735521, 68947, '<td valign="top">Really different editing and very nicely done!  Love the perspective/angle of the strip.  The building being condemned seems like they took a great deal of care to keep the front of it looking nicely...ie: the painted window and doors???</td>', 'Really different editing and very nicely done!  Love the perspective/angle of the strip.  The building being condemned seems like they took a great deal of care to keep the front of it looking nicely...ie: the painted window and doors???', '2008-11-04 21:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044296, 735939, 68947, '<td valign="top">Very spooky looking with the editing.  Nice job!  I''m just kind of wondering who comes to trim the hedges? *smile*  They look like they''ve been upkept fairly recently.</td>', 'Very spooky looking with the editing.  Nice job!  I''m just kind of wondering who comes to trim the hedges? *smile*  They look like they''ve been upkept fairly recently.', '2008-11-04 21:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044301, 735718, 68947, '<td valign="top">Makes a great point and love the crop to this shot.  A tad over contrasted likely for DPCer''s tastes but, hey...who knows?  Perhaps, they''re starting to "swing" a bit in their tastes!  Fingers crossed!</td>', 'Makes a great point and love the crop to this shot.  A tad over contrasted likely for DPCer''s tastes but, hey...who knows?  Perhaps, they''re starting to "swing" a bit in their tastes!  Fingers crossed!', '2008-11-04 21:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044303, 735558, 68947, '<td valign="top">Hey, someone should build a wooden box for where the engine was and turn it into a lovely planter!  Now, that would stop cars and turn heads!  Nicely photographed.</td>', 'Hey, someone should build a wooden box for where the engine was and turn it into a lovely planter!  Now, that would stop cars and turn heads!  Nicely photographed.', '2008-11-04 21:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044304, 735985, 68947, '<td valign="top">very nicely done...coloring and context show abandonment...thinking more the building than the cat though...*smile*  Kitty looks well taken care of, thankfully! :)</td>', 'very nicely done...coloring and context show abandonment...thinking more the building than the cat though...*smile*  Kitty looks well taken care of, thankfully! :)', '2008-11-04 21:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044307, 735927, 68947, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective running through this shot with the rail lines.</td>', 'I like the perspective running through this shot with the rail lines.', '2008-11-04 21:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044309, 735043, 68947, '<td valign="top">To me, this shot says abandoned but, for a different reason...abandoned for a snow sled! LOL  Nice shot...nice angle.</td>', 'To me, this shot says abandoned but, for a different reason...abandoned for a snow sled! LOL  Nice shot...nice angle.', '2008-11-04 21:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044312, 735720, 68947, '<td valign="top">Well, it says abandoned but, I wasn''t sure whether you meant the house or the cat! LOL  I think this may have had more impact had either the cat been the focus by zooming in, or had the entire shot been zoomed out on so that more of it could have been seen.  The composition just lacks something, somewhere...not sure what it is???</td>', 'Well, it says abandoned but, I wasn''t sure whether you meant the house or the cat! LOL  I think this may have had more impact had either the cat been the focus by zooming in, or had the entire shot been zoomed out on so that more of it could have been seen.  The composition just lacks something, somewhere...not sure what it is???', '2008-11-04 21:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044316, 735478, 68947, '<td valign="top">it says abandoned but, it seems that there''s something amiss with the composition...like perspective or something needed in it other than the door and window???  Not sure what would have improved this as I don''t know what else was around it.</td>', 'it says abandoned but, it seems that there''s something amiss with the composition...like perspective or something needed in it other than the door and window???  Not sure what would have improved this as I don''t know what else was around it.', '2008-11-04 21:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044317, 735864, 68947, '<td valign="top">Eerie....a bit dark on my screen, even changing settings.</td>', 'Eerie....a bit dark on my screen, even changing settings.', '2008-11-04 21:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044320, 735468, 68947, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Not quite sure on what to say here because it gives the idea of abandoned but, the tight crop to it kind of "cuts off" the shot...as though we want to see more of it but that''s all that there is???</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Not quite sure on what to say here because it gives the idea of abandoned but, the tight crop to it kind of "cuts off" the shot...as though we want to see more of it but that''s all that there is???', '2008-11-04 21:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044323, 735948, 68947, '<td valign="top">I like the way this was shot and edited.  The woman stands out very well and focuses attention onto both her and the building behind it because of the contrast from colour to B&amp;W.  However....this says more "stranded" than abandoned to me.</td>', 'I like the way this was shot and edited.  The woman stands out very well and focuses attention onto both her and the building behind it because of the contrast from colour to B&W.  However....this says more "stranded" than abandoned to me.', '2008-11-04 22:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044327, 735999, 68947, '<td valign="top">I really like the angle to this and the stop in the foreground.  It makes a bold statement.  However, I''m not so sure about the bluish tinge to this shot.  It kind of throws me off a bit.  Why not leave it in B&amp;W?</td>', 'I really like the angle to this and the stop in the foreground.  It makes a bold statement.  However, I''m not so sure about the bluish tinge to this shot.  It kind of throws me off a bit.  Why not leave it in B&W?', '2008-11-04 22:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044329, 735567, 68947, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting!!</td>', 'Lovely lighting!!', '2008-11-04 22:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044334, 736007, 68947, '<td valign="top">LOVE the greenery growing from the top of the car here!  Very nicely shot and edited!</td>', 'LOVE the greenery growing from the top of the car here!  Very nicely shot and edited!', '2008-11-04 22:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044335, 735408, 68947, '<td valign="top">The tones and noise and contrast to this shot certainly set the mood and it''s very well shot.  I wish we could see the house more because it''s not certain from this angle that it is abandoned???</td>', 'The tones and noise and contrast to this shot certainly set the mood and it''s very well shot.  I wish we could see the house more because it''s not certain from this angle that it is abandoned???', '2008-11-04 22:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044336, 736093, 68947, '<td valign="top">The rusted bike clearly shows abandonment and a rather artsy approach to it which is my tastes.  I think that the vignetting is a little darker than I''d like to see it but, it''s a great shot!</td>', 'The rusted bike clearly shows abandonment and a rather artsy approach to it which is my tastes.  I think that the vignetting is a little darker than I''d like to see it but, it''s a great shot!', '2008-11-04 22:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044337, 735022, 68947, '<td valign="top">lovely colors, lovely lighting, well shot!  Very pretty photo....just doesn''t seem like abandonded...more like a solitary stroll along the beach, stopping to look out at the water.</td>', 'lovely colors, lovely lighting, well shot!  Very pretty photo....just doesn''t seem like abandonded...more like a solitary stroll along the beach, stopping to look out at the water.', '2008-11-04 22:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044343, 735993, 68947, '<td valign="top">interesting concept for abandoned.  I like the wall behind as the backdrop and the idea of the colour in front of it.  Seems that "poverty" is quite the topic to photograph the last couple of challenges, doesn''t it?  I''m just not sure that I''d get the idea of it being a place someone sleeps without the title??  To me, it appears like a bunch of stuff, left behind, which does say, abandoned but, has no real "punch" to the look of the photograph itself.  Perhaps, having zoomed in more to it???</td>', 'interesting concept for abandoned.  I like the wall behind as the backdrop and the idea of the colour in front of it.  Seems that "poverty" is quite the topic to photograph the last couple of challenges, doesn''t it?  I''m just not sure that I''d get the idea of it being a place someone sleeps without the title??  To me, it appears like a bunch of stuff, left behind, which does say, abandoned but, has no real "punch" to the look of the photograph itself.  Perhaps, having zoomed in more to it???', '2008-11-04 22:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044346, 735866, 68947, '<td valign="top">I''d have missed the focus of your shot had it not been for the title but, very nicely photographed landscape!  Love the sky...Is that mountains in the background?</td>', 'I''d have missed the focus of your shot had it not been for the title but, very nicely photographed landscape!  Love the sky...Is that mountains in the background?', '2008-11-04 22:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044349, 736083, 68947, '<td valign="top">More like "wreckless abandon" I''d say! LOL</td>', 'More like "wreckless abandon" I''d say! LOL', '2008-11-04 22:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044352, 735906, 68947, '<td valign="top">The details in this shot seem to be over contrasted so they get lost somewhat and one has to look very closely to see what is really happening in this shot.  Certainly says "abandoned" though!</td>', 'The details in this shot seem to be over contrasted so they get lost somewhat and one has to look very closely to see what is really happening in this shot.  Certainly says "abandoned" though!', '2008-11-04 22:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044353, 734839, 68947, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful shot....well done, colours are beautiful and the focus is terrific...just not sure that without the title, I''d see this as abandoned</td>', 'Very beautiful shot....well done, colours are beautiful and the focus is terrific...just not sure that without the title, I''d see this as abandoned', '2008-11-04 22:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044355, 735748, 68947, '<td valign="top">Great shot, lovely colors, editing, well shot but, doesn''t say abandoned to me, personally</td>', 'Great shot, lovely colors, editing, well shot but, doesn''t say abandoned to me, personally', '2008-11-04 22:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044356, 735833, 68947, '<td valign="top">This really does say abandoned once it''s really looked at to see the boarded up windows but, I think that it''s the lack of detail that''s creating the difficulty in seeing the boards.  It''s not as obvious this way.  Perhaps, it was over coloured or, not sharpened enough?</td>', 'This really does say abandoned once it''s really looked at to see the boarded up windows but, I think that it''s the lack of detail that''s creating the difficulty in seeing the boards.  It''s not as obvious this way.  Perhaps, it was over coloured or, not sharpened enough?', '2008-11-04 22:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044362, 736013, 68947, '<td valign="top">It appears as though there''s some graffiti on the front left side of the door but, the editing has blurred it out.  Why so much over editing to this shot?  It would have been extremely eye-catching on it''s own.  I don''t know how else to say this but, it''s almost as though trying to make something pretty out of an "eyesore".  Why not just leave it looking like that as the idea of being abandoned is not pretty? *smile*  Very lovely picture though!</td>', 'It appears as though there''s some graffiti on the front left side of the door but, the editing has blurred it out.  Why so much over editing to this shot?  It would have been extremely eye-catching on it''s own.  I don''t know how else to say this but, it''s almost as though trying to make something pretty out of an "eyesore".  Why not just leave it looking like that as the idea of being abandoned is not pretty? *smile*  Very lovely picture though!', '2008-11-04 22:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044365, 736009, 68947, '<td valign="top">Very abstract!  Love the interesting designs this has created.  But...yeah, had to be one...this doesn''t say abandoned to me.  It''s a very lovely abstract.</td>', 'Very abstract!  Love the interesting designs this has created.  But...yeah, had to be one...this doesn''t say abandoned to me.  It''s a very lovely abstract.', '2008-11-04 22:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044367, 735721, 68947, '<td valign="top">Must have been a pretty place in it''s glory days.  I think that it''s a little too unconstrated for a lot of DPCers tastes through my own experiences but, it''s got a lot of charm to it.  Makes one wonder what laid behind those walls at one point, doesn''t it?</td>', 'Must have been a pretty place in it''s glory days.  I think that it''s a little too unconstrated for a lot of DPCers tastes through my own experiences but, it''s got a lot of charm to it.  Makes one wonder what laid behind those walls at one point, doesn''t it?', '2008-11-04 22:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044369, 735828, 68947, '<td valign="top">The door on this came out very clear but, the boy looks very well taken care of and his face is a bit too dark.  Doesn''t seem to say "abandoned" to me.</td>', 'The door on this came out very clear but, the boy looks very well taken care of and his face is a bit too dark.  Doesn''t seem to say "abandoned" to me.', '2008-11-04 22:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044370, 734987, 68947, '<td valign="top">BEAUTIFUL shot....has a real "lonely" look to it but, just doesn''t say "abandoned".</td>', 'BEAUTIFUL shot....has a real "lonely" look to it but, just doesn''t say "abandoned".', '2008-11-04 22:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044371, 736085, 68947, '<td valign="top">Really interesting perspective in this shot!  I love the angle you shot it on and the barnicles/moss on it!  This may be one of my favorites thus far!</td>', 'Really interesting perspective in this shot!  I love the angle you shot it on and the barnicles/moss on it!  This may be one of my favorites thus far!', '2008-11-04 22:17:01.000000', NULL, 1);
