(5044378, 736019, 68947, '<td valign="top">I''m sure that you were going for the attention on the teddy bear and it really does say abandoned very nicely!  Not sure if it''s my screen or not but, it''s pretty dark.  Still, I love the concept of this and the fact that it''s not a clean bear, laying there.</td>', 'I''m sure that you were going for the attention on the teddy bear and it really does say abandoned very nicely!  Not sure if it''s my screen or not but, it''s pretty dark.  Still, I love the concept of this and the fact that it''s not a clean bear, laying there.', '2008-11-04 22:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044379, 735925, 68947, '<td valign="top">Very nicely edited and shot. Love the tones to this shot.  I know the aim was to make her look abandoned, but to me, she''s a pretty model, trying to look the part but can''t do it as she''s too refined.  The shot is beautiful but, doesn''t fully say abandoned in my personal opinion</td>', 'Very nicely edited and shot. Love the tones to this shot.  I know the aim was to make her look abandoned, but to me, she''s a pretty model, trying to look the part but can''t do it as she''s too refined.  The shot is beautiful but, doesn''t fully say abandoned in my personal opinion', '2008-11-04 22:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
