(5044402, 735699, 68947, '<td valign="top">Brrrrr!  We just got our first taste of that white stuff last week too.  Nicely done!  You know, this reminds me of a shot that my parents had of an old car of theirs and the tone to it matches so perfectly!  I really ike this one.  It has a "feel" to it!</td>', 'Brrrrr!  We just got our first taste of that white stuff last week too.  Nicely done!  You know, this reminds me of a shot that my parents had of an old car of theirs and the tone to it matches so perfectly!  I really ike this one.  It has a "feel" to it!', '2008-11-04 22:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044403, 735832, 68947, '<td valign="top">This is very different from the literal interpretation and is very nicely portrayed here.  I like it.  The only criticism that I''d have is the texture to the background jetting out from behind her.  It''s quite distracting being so in focus.  It has a life of it''s own and because of the lightness to it, my eye wants to look at it first.</td>', 'This is very different from the literal interpretation and is very nicely portrayed here.  I like it.  The only criticism that I''d have is the texture to the background jetting out from behind her.  It''s quite distracting being so in focus.  It has a life of it''s own and because of the lightness to it, my eye wants to look at it first.', '2008-11-04 22:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5044406, 736015, 68947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky...but, not sure what that item is as it''s unclear.  At first, I thought it was a bag of some kind???</td>', 'Beautiful sky...but, not sure what that item is as it''s unclear.  At first, I thought it was a bag of some kind???', '2008-11-04 22:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
