(5047959, 735951, 45475, '<td valign="top">Classic country barn image, only this one is about to implode! The composition is good, but the colours and light seem a little dull and flat.</td>', 'Classic country barn image, only this one is about to implode! The composition is good, but the colours and light seem a little dull and flat.', '2008-11-05 22:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
