(5048876, 735864, 96750, '<td valign="top">wow...where is this? it''s just amazing! it''s a perfect setting and the photo is just great!</td>', 'wow...where is this? it''s just amazing! it''s a perfect setting and the photo is just great!', '2008-11-06 13:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049247, 736097, 45475, '<td valign="top">Maybe she didn''t like your flip-flops? Not saying that''s the reason of course... just that it could be, you know, the "ick" factor in the relationship. Hard to get past the "ick". Oh, you can pretend for a little while, but it does start to grate on you. The silly <i>squish-flap</i> sound as you walked by, that may have been endearing at the start and she''d giggle and tease you playfully, got really old after a few months. Even in the winter when you weren''t wearing them any more, it was already too late, the damage had been done. She''d associated you with <i>squish-flap squish-flap squish-flap squish-flap</i> and you became merely an annoying sound in her head...<br/> <br/>But then again, it''s probably not that at all. Well, maybe not <i>only</i> that. Could have been the combination of flip-flops <i>and</i> Steve Urkel length pants you love to wear...</td>', 'Maybe she didn''t like your flip-flops? Not saying that''s the reason of course... just that it could be, you know, the "ick" factor in the relationship. Hard to get past the "ick". Oh, you can pretend for a little while, but it does start to grate on you. The silly squish-flap sound as you walked by, that may have been endearing at the start and she''d giggle and tease you playfully, got really old after a few months. Even in the winter when you weren''t wearing them any more, it was already too late, the damage had been done. She''d associated you with squish-flap squish-flap squish-flap squish-flap and you became merely an annoying sound in her head... But then again, it''s probably not that at all. Well, maybe not only that. Could have been the combination of flip-flops and Steve Urkel length pants you love to wear...', '2008-11-06 16:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049263, 735836, 45475, '<td valign="top">This is great. I really like the overcast light here. Wonder if a subtle vignette would give this a bit more drama...</td>', 'This is great. I really like the overcast light here. Wonder if a subtle vignette would give this a bit more drama...', '2008-11-06 16:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049298, 736005, 45475, '<td valign="top">Kinda strikes me as funny to see a rubbish bin with recent litter about. As though this abandoned place is some sort of tourist attraction.<br/> <br/>I like the lean. Adds interest to an otherwise boring scene. Nice.</td>', 'Kinda strikes me as funny to see a rubbish bin with recent litter about. As though this abandoned place is some sort of tourist attraction. I like the lean. Adds interest to an otherwise boring scene. Nice.', '2008-11-06 17:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049304, 736114, 45475, '<td valign="top">Great dramatic skies and shadows. I think noise removal has taken away too much of the fine detail though.</td>', 'Great dramatic skies and shadows. I think noise removal has taken away too much of the fine detail though.', '2008-11-06 17:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049309, 736091, 45475, '<td valign="top">I think this is an example of how processing can cross the line from photography over to drawing. I think it''s a great moody scene, I like it, but has ceased to be a photograph.</td>', 'I think this is an example of how processing can cross the line from photography over to drawing. I think it''s a great moody scene, I like it, but has ceased to be a photograph.', '2008-11-06 17:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049315, 736085, 45475, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s been in the water a mighty long time! A great find. I just think it needs a bit more room around the frame.</td>', 'Wow, that''s been in the water a mighty long time! A great find. I just think it needs a bit more room around the frame.', '2008-11-06 17:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049318, 735937, 45475, '<td valign="top">Title made me laugh :D Love the warm afternoon glow here. Really nice to look at.</td>', 'Title made me laugh :D Love the warm afternoon glow here. Really nice to look at.', '2008-11-06 17:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049322, 735983, 45475, '<td valign="top">Nice subject matter and good editing. Just a tiny bit more contrast around the edges of frame would have been cool.</td>', 'Nice subject matter and good editing. Just a tiny bit more contrast around the edges of frame would have been cool.', '2008-11-06 17:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049326, 735864, 45475, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh, what have you done here? Excellent work. Asylum you say? Incredible, that looks to be the leftovers of a crib over on the right. Heartbreaking.</td>', 'Oh my gosh, what have you done here? Excellent work. Asylum you say? Incredible, that looks to be the leftovers of a crib over on the right. Heartbreaking.', '2008-11-06 17:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049330, 736027, 45475, '<td valign="top">Very difficult to truly grasp the terrible living conditions these people face daily. Abandoned by their government, or merely just the way of life?</td>', 'Very difficult to truly grasp the terrible living conditions these people face daily. Abandoned by their government, or merely just the way of life?', '2008-11-06 17:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049331, 735965, 45475, '<td valign="top">Heh, it sure is for those birds. Wish I could have seen more of the boat though.</td>', 'Heh, it sure is for those birds. Wish I could have seen more of the boat though.', '2008-11-06 17:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049339, 736100, 45475, '<td valign="top">Fantastic colour in this.</td>', 'Fantastic colour in this.', '2008-11-06 17:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049342, 736013, 45475, '<td valign="top">You''ve made something ugly and scary into pretty and magical.</td>', 'You''ve made something ugly and scary into pretty and magical.', '2008-11-06 17:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049343, 736123, 54446, '<td valign="top">It''s a really great photo.  But, the front end loader is so recently used, it still has teeth rubbed shiny and mud on the tires.  Good photo, though.</td>', 'It''s a really great photo.  But, the front end loader is so recently used, it still has teeth rubbed shiny and mud on the tires.  Good photo, though.', '2008-11-06 17:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049345, 736126, 45475, '<td valign="top">Great crop to fill the frame. Not a pretty photo though is it? But I really like the textures and colour.</td>', 'Great crop to fill the frame. Not a pretty photo though is it? But I really like the textures and colour.', '2008-11-06 17:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049348, 734790, 45475, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colour palette! I''d be inclined to clean up the two specks on the water, but other than that, I''d be jumping for joy at taking this shot. Congrats!</td>', 'Gorgeous colour palette! I''d be inclined to clean up the two specks on the water, but other than that, I''d be jumping for joy at taking this shot. Congrats!', '2008-11-06 17:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049354, 735809, 54446, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great title for an amazingly polluted/toxic image.  This is really good and I hope it wins a well-deserved win!  (9)</td>', 'Wow!  Great title for an amazingly polluted/toxic image.  This is really good and I hope it wins a well-deserved win!  (9)', '2008-11-06 18:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049355, 735866, 54446, '<td valign="top">I love the banding of colors and light in the image.  The very abandoned boat is wonderfully framed by the great landscape.  Hope this image wins a well deserved ribbon.  (9)</td>', 'I love the banding of colors and light in the image.  The very abandoned boat is wonderfully framed by the great landscape.  Hope this image wins a well deserved ribbon.  (9)', '2008-11-06 18:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049356, 734839, 54446, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully historic and poignant image.  I had this same idea, but didn''t have time to travel.  This is my pick for the best of this challenge.  Great work!  (10)</td>', 'Wonderfully historic and poignant image.  I had this same idea, but didn''t have time to travel.  This is my pick for the best of this challenge.  Great work!  (10)', '2008-11-06 18:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049357, 735897, 54446, '<td valign="top">Very nice perspective and a historical capture.  Well done!  (8)</td>', 'Very nice perspective and a historical capture.  Well done!  (8)', '2008-11-06 18:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049359, 735832, 54446, '<td valign="top">The vignette, the hat, the photo and the emotion captured in the model work well here to tell the story.  (8)</td>', 'The vignette, the hat, the photo and the emotion captured in the model work well here to tell the story.  (8)', '2008-11-06 18:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049360, 735720, 45475, '<td valign="top">Left behind, or refused to leave?? ;) Love the "gas off". A warning to potential squatters maybe. Nice find.</td>', 'Left behind, or refused to leave?? ;) Love the "gas off". A warning to potential squatters maybe. Nice find.', '2008-11-06 18:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049361, 735646, 45475, '<td valign="top">Like how you''ve worked the light here. Very clever.</td>', 'Like how you''ve worked the light here. Very clever.', '2008-11-06 18:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049363, 735665, 54446, '<td valign="top">Of the abandoned building images, I like this one the best.  Well seen and captured.  (8)</td>', 'Of the abandoned building images, I like this one the best.  Well seen and captured.  (8)', '2008-11-06 18:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049365, 735753, 45475, '<td valign="top">The colour gradient in the sky is pretty freaky. Detail looks strange, as though you may have applied an arty filter. Not bad, just different.</td>', 'The colour gradient in the sky is pretty freaky. Detail looks strange, as though you may have applied an arty filter. Not bad, just different.', '2008-11-06 18:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049371, 736015, 45475, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what I''m looking at. Balloon? Outrageous hat? Alien ball? Oh well, not to worry. It''s managed to get itself abandoned on very beautiful farmland and on a fantastic day :)</td>', 'I have no idea what I''m looking at. Balloon? Outrageous hat? Alien ball? Oh well, not to worry. It''s managed to get itself abandoned on very beautiful farmland and on a fantastic day :)', '2008-11-06 18:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049372, 735824, 45475, '<td valign="top">Good use of selective desat. Like the perspective too.</td>', 'Good use of selective desat. Like the perspective too.', '2008-11-06 18:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049373, 735552, 45475, '<td valign="top">You would have been better off saving this for the free study. Awesome macro. Could use a little more sharpness on the little guy.</td>', 'You would have been better off saving this for the free study. Awesome macro. Could use a little more sharpness on the little guy.', '2008-11-06 18:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049374, 735939, 45475, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Creepy and totally cool.</td>', 'Excellent! Creepy and totally cool.', '2008-11-06 18:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049375, 735718, 45475, '<td valign="top">This is when colour saturation really adds so much to the feel. Awesome work on both the editing and the shot.</td>', 'This is when colour saturation really adds so much to the feel. Awesome work on both the editing and the shot.', '2008-11-06 18:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049389, 735575, 45475, '<td valign="top">There''s a strangeness to the vignette. Almost looks negative. For a posed shot, her expression looks completely real. Nice work.</td>', 'There''s a strangeness to the vignette. Almost looks negative. For a posed shot, her expression looks completely real. Nice work.', '2008-11-06 18:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049391, 734987, 45475, '<td valign="top">Very lovely. Nicely framed.</td>', 'Very lovely. Nicely framed.', '2008-11-06 18:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049392, 735183, 45475, '<td valign="top">Not sure how to feel about this. Cool shot, but my first thought is: yeah, well, get over it. ;)</td>', 'Not sure how to feel about this. Cool shot, but my first thought is: yeah, well, get over it. ;)', '2008-11-06 18:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049393, 735022, 45475, '<td valign="top">I dig the long shadow. Nice set up and comp.</td>', 'I dig the long shadow. Nice set up and comp.', '2008-11-06 18:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049395, 736123, 45475, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... I''m not so sure about that. Great colour, light and wide angle perspective, but I seriously doubt it''s been abandoned. The guys have just knocked off for the day is all.</td>', 'Hmmm... I''m not so sure about that. Great colour, light and wide angle perspective, but I seriously doubt it''s been abandoned. The guys have just knocked off for the day is all.', '2008-11-06 18:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049490, 735967, 45475, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully rich tones. Nicely done.</td>', 'Wonderfully rich tones. Nicely done.', '2008-11-06 19:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049494, 736093, 45475, '<td valign="top">Yay for lensbaby! I wondered when I''d come across one, perfect challenge for it. Love the story to this. Sad, chilling and well told in pictures.</td>', 'Yay for lensbaby! I wondered when I''d come across one, perfect challenge for it. Love the story to this. Sad, chilling and well told in pictures.', '2008-11-06 19:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049522, 735757, 45475, '<td valign="top">Poor Mr McCartney... pinned up and used as backing. Well hey, he hasn''t been totally abandoned.</td>', 'Poor Mr McCartney... pinned up and used as backing. Well hey, he hasn''t been totally abandoned.', '2008-11-06 19:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049526, 736086, 45475, '<td valign="top">Nice tones, composition and point of view. Just missing something in whole. Like maybe some drama in the sky?</td>', 'Nice tones, composition and point of view. Just missing something in whole. Like maybe some drama in the sky?', '2008-11-06 19:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049528, 735182, 45475, '<td valign="top">Bam! Love those lines and curves!</td>', 'Bam! Love those lines and curves!', '2008-11-06 19:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049541, 735741, 45475, '<td valign="top">Great cinematic crop for this. I''m liking the saturation on the grass. There''s a light spot behind the stable on the left that looks oddly out of synch though.</td>', 'Great cinematic crop for this. I''m liking the saturation on the grass. There''s a light spot behind the stable on the left that looks oddly out of synch though.', '2008-11-06 19:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049543, 735286, 45475, '<td valign="top">Not altogether certain where you''re going with this, but it''s a lovely photograph. Crisp, fresh and great dof.</td>', 'Not altogether certain where you''re going with this, but it''s a lovely photograph. Crisp, fresh and great dof.', '2008-11-06 19:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049554, 735897, 92907, '<td valign="top">Great perspective</td>', 'Great perspective', '2008-11-06 20:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049558, 736093, 92907, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and focus on the bike...it works. well done.</td>', 'I really like the composition and focus on the bike...it works. well done.', '2008-11-06 20:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049582, 736007, 70514, '<td valign="top">For the most part I really like how this was processed, except the gravel parts on the lower right corner.  But that''s minor.  It almost looks like there was a texture added, or this was shot through a window (that sky is just amazing).  I like the colors, perspective and great grittiness of it.</td>', 'For the most part I really like how this was processed, except the gravel parts on the lower right corner.  But that''s minor.  It almost looks like there was a texture added, or this was shot through a window (that sky is just amazing).  I like the colors, perspective and great grittiness of it.', '2008-11-06 20:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049583, 735718, 70514, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and sunlighting all the right spots.</td>', 'Lovely composition and sunlighting all the right spots.', '2008-11-06 20:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049585, 736013, 70514, '<td valign="top">Beautiful greens against the home.  Lovely soft processing to contrast it as well.</td>', 'Beautiful greens against the home.  Lovely soft processing to contrast it as well.', '2008-11-06 20:47:02.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5049587, 735156, 70514, '<td valign="top">Yikes!  I love how you processed this (and the fact you got on there and took this is quite brave, as I''m a complete chicken about those things). The perspective and leading line is wonderful.</td>', 'Yikes!  I love how you processed this (and the fact you got on there and took this is quite brave, as I''m a complete chicken about those things). The perspective and leading line is wonderful.', '2008-11-06 20:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049590, 735639, 70514, '<td valign="top">Quite a sad image, especially with the water puddle reflecting only part of it.  Great contrasting lines, textures and colors.  The sky is a bit of a shame, but hardly catches my eye, really.</td>', 'Quite a sad image, especially with the water puddle reflecting only part of it.  Great contrasting lines, textures and colors.  The sky is a bit of a shame, but hardly catches my eye, really.', '2008-11-06 20:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049595, 735183, 70514, '<td valign="top">Who can''t relate to this?  The only thing is it appears she has a bit of a smile, but that could just be, of course.  A very lovely and interesting image, in a good way.</td>', 'Who can''t relate to this?  The only thing is it appears she has a bit of a smile, but that could just be, of course.  A very lovely and interesting image, in a good way.', '2008-11-06 20:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049598, 735864, 70514, '<td valign="top">Very eerie and nightmarish.</td>', 'Very eerie and nightmarish.', '2008-11-06 20:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5049608, 736008, 70514, '<td valign="top">I kind of like the tilt here.  At first I wasn''t so sure, but then it really seemed to add to the tumultous feelings of losing your business (or anything else, for that matter).</td>', 'I kind of like the tilt here.  At first I wasn''t so sure, but then it really seemed to add to the tumultous feelings of losing your business (or anything else, for that matter).', '2008-11-06 21:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
