(5051693, 735753, 96915, '<td valign="top">The green on the horizon doesn''t appear natural, and I find it a little distracting.  I love the boat and it seems so loaded with photographic opportunities.  I''d like to see more of it and less of the green sky.</td>', 'The green on the horizon doesn''t appear natural, and I find it a little distracting.  I love the boat and it seems so loaded with photographic opportunities.  I''d like to see more of it and less of the green sky.', '2008-11-07 23:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
