(5053454, 736126, 86799, '<td valign="top">This is the exact spirit of the challenge, IMO.  But...there''s too much of it.  It might be better cropped down or re-shot to include just the one window, but off center, with only a few panels of high-detail rust surrounding it.  A bit of telephoto, maybe.</td>', 'This is the exact spirit of the challenge, IMO.  But...there''s too much of it.  It might be better cropped down or re-shot to include just the one window, but off center, with only a few panels of high-detail rust surrounding it.  A bit of telephoto, maybe.', '2008-11-09 06:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053464, 735698, 86799, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I''m missing the significance of the time and name and veil.  Nicely executed.</td>', 'Sorry, I''m missing the significance of the time and name and veil.  Nicely executed.', '2008-11-09 06:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053493, 735622, 86799, '<td valign="top">sail boat does not look like it''s sinking.  Not much "abandoned" here, IMO.</td>', 'sail boat does not look like it''s sinking.  Not much "abandoned" here, IMO.', '2008-11-09 07:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053499, 735022, 86799, '<td valign="top">OK, but missing the feel of "abandoned" except for the title.</td>', 'OK, but missing the feel of "abandoned" except for the title.', '2008-11-09 07:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053500, 735553, 86799, '<td valign="top">Nice pic, but IMO the only thing that says "abandoned" is the title.</td>', 'Nice pic, but IMO the only thing that says "abandoned" is the title.', '2008-11-09 07:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053501, 735662, 86799, '<td valign="top">According to the current decorations and menu in the window and fresh paint job this is hardly abandoned.</td>', 'According to the current decorations and menu in the window and fresh paint job this is hardly abandoned.', '2008-11-09 07:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053502, 735728, 86799, '<td valign="top">Cute pic, but apart from the title, does not say "abandoned" as much as "explorer"</td>', 'Cute pic, but apart from the title, does not say "abandoned" as much as "explorer"', '2008-11-09 07:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053507, 735925, 86799, '<td valign="top">Looks contrived.</td>', 'Looks contrived.', '2008-11-09 07:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053508, 735992, 86799, '<td valign="top">I''m not seeing "abandoned" at all.</td>', 'I''m not seeing "abandoned" at all.', '2008-11-09 07:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053510, 736123, 86799, '<td valign="top">Kind of a shoehorn...doesn''t look abandoned so much as "at rest" between jobs.  Tracks are neat, points on bucket are sharp and clean.  And it''s in the middle of a construction area.</td>', 'Kind of a shoehorn...doesn''t look abandoned so much as "at rest" between jobs.  Tracks are neat, points on bucket are sharp and clean.  And it''s in the middle of a construction area.', '2008-11-09 07:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053578, 736012, 62187, '<td valign="top">Whatever - just take your ribbon and be gone...10</td>', 'Whatever - just take your ribbon and be gone...10', '2008-11-09 09:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053650, 735848, 75172, '<td valign="top">xx</td>', 'xx', '2008-11-09 11:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053669, 734987, 76335, '<td valign="top">Abandoned? If the structure is part of a rail line or some other abandoned thing, the image doesn''t give enough context for us to make the connection.</td>', 'Abandoned? If the structure is part of a rail line or some other abandoned thing, the image doesn''t give enough context for us to make the connection.', '2008-11-09 11:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053671, 736008, 76335, '<td valign="top">Certainly abandoned, but the tilt doesn''t add anything. The tie-in with the title is a bit too ambitious. As far as the technicals, capturing this just before dusk or after dawn might have given more interesting lighting, shown off the textures better.</td>', 'Certainly abandoned, but the tilt doesn''t add anything. The tie-in with the title is a bit too ambitious. As far as the technicals, capturing this just before dusk or after dawn might have given more interesting lighting, shown off the textures better.', '2008-11-09 11:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053673, 735658, 76335, '<td valign="top">Way overstaturated, not terribly interesting. I think working on crisper focus, a different angle, more flattering lighting (any or all of those) would have shown off your subject better.</td>', 'Way overstaturated, not terribly interesting. I think working on crisper focus, a different angle, more flattering lighting (any or all of those) would have shown off your subject better.', '2008-11-09 11:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053769, 736027, 97166, '<td valign="top">An aesthetically pleasing shot that says more "poverty" to me than abandoned.  The very fact that there is a person here, not to mention that it seems pretty well maintained for all its apparent run-down, isn''t strong on the challenge theme.</td>', 'An aesthetically pleasing shot that says more "poverty" to me than abandoned.  The very fact that there is a person here, not to mention that it seems pretty well maintained for all its apparent run-down, isn''t strong on the challenge theme.', '2008-11-09 13:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053771, 735635, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Great composition, and the exposure is perfect. The colors are just right. Love the sky.</td>', 'Beautiful. Great composition, and the exposure is perfect. The colors are just right. Love the sky.', '2008-11-09 13:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053772, 735697, 76335, '<td valign="top">The colors really make this shot for me. The lighting is perfect. Something is clearly lighting the front of the house, but it looks like it''s dark outside. I''ll be curious to read about this one.</td>', 'The colors really make this shot for me. The lighting is perfect. Something is clearly lighting the front of the house, but it looks like it''s dark outside. I''ll be curious to read about this one.', '2008-11-09 13:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053773, 736123, 97166, '<td valign="top">Abandoned, or simply done for the work-day?  A 5, but not my idea of abandonment.  The machine in question shows no signs of disuse or typical wear and tear that a truly abandoned piece of machinery would show.  It''s obviously been recently used.</td>', 'Abandoned, or simply done for the work-day?  A 5, but not my idea of abandonment.  The machine in question shows no signs of disuse or typical wear and tear that a truly abandoned piece of machinery would show.  It''s obviously been recently used.', '2008-11-09 13:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053860, 735828, 45475, '<td valign="top">The light and colour captures the atmosphere well. Depressing reality.</td>', 'The light and colour captures the atmosphere well. Depressing reality.', '2008-11-09 15:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053874, 735639, 45475, '<td valign="top">A thought provoking title to go with this photograph. Something appears to have gone awry upon resize or saving for web though, as I''m seeing odd pixel distortion throughout the image. Over-sharp/jagged edges alongside blurred areas. It''s distracting me away from fully enjoying the story you''re trying to tell.</td>', 'A thought provoking title to go with this photograph. Something appears to have gone awry upon resize or saving for web though, as I''m seeing odd pixel distortion throughout the image. Over-sharp/jagged edges alongside blurred areas. It''s distracting me away from fully enjoying the story you''re trying to tell.', '2008-11-09 16:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053883, 735976, 45475, '<td valign="top">Nice minimalist approach to the topic. I''m not really connecting with it at all though. Meaning, I can''t see a connection between title and image, or image with topic. That''s okay, I''m sure others will get this without a problem, I''m just not your intended audience I guess. I do like the colour in this. The blue and brown work well together.</td>', 'Nice minimalist approach to the topic. I''m not really connecting with it at all though. Meaning, I can''t see a connection between title and image, or image with topic. That''s okay, I''m sure others will get this without a problem, I''m just not your intended audience I guess. I do like the colour in this. The blue and brown work well together.', '2008-11-09 16:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053884, 735848, 45475, '<td valign="top">I like this image but, stepping back or zooming out a bit would give the car room to complete its form, maybe leaving the wheel just touching the bottom of the frame. I also wonder if a little diffused fill flash would help give each patterned element chance to come to life.</td>', 'I like this image but, stepping back or zooming out a bit would give the car room to complete its form, maybe leaving the wheel just touching the bottom of the frame. I also wonder if a little diffused fill flash would help give each patterned element chance to come to life.', '2008-11-09 16:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053891, 735703, 45475, '<td valign="top">A lovely narrative. Excellent work.</td>', 'A lovely narrative. Excellent work.', '2008-11-09 16:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053893, 735553, 45475, '<td valign="top">Oh bless her... she looks like a lovely young girl with a coy smile for everyone. The light and colour feels dull and flat though. Intentional maybe? If so, I think it spoils a little.</td>', 'Oh bless her... she looks like a lovely young girl with a coy smile for everyone. The light and colour feels dull and flat though. Intentional maybe? If so, I think it spoils a little.', '2008-11-09 16:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053896, 735521, 45475, '<td valign="top">Ghost town-ish. In need of some tumblin'' tumbleweed ;) Maybe a touch too much on the yellow side of sepia, but I love the harshness of the processing all the same. Nicely done.</td>', 'Ghost town-ish. In need of some tumblin'' tumbleweed ;) Maybe a touch too much on the yellow side of sepia, but I love the harshness of the processing all the same. Nicely done.', '2008-11-09 16:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053897, 735746, 45475, '<td valign="top">So many layers can be pulled back here. What would they reveal? Wonderful work. The outside world beyond looks like a painting.</td>', 'So many layers can be pulled back here. What would they reveal? Wonderful work. The outside world beyond looks like a painting.', '2008-11-09 16:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053899, 735478, 45475, '<td valign="top">Simple and to the point. Nicely composed and treated.</td>', 'Simple and to the point. Nicely composed and treated.', '2008-11-09 16:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053905, 735712, 45475, '<td valign="top">The horizon is tilted but that''s not so much an issue at this pov and perspective. However, I do see a big problem with contrast in the foreground grass. A quick curves or contrast adjustment in post could fix that, then you''d have a more interesting lead in.</td>', 'The horizon is tilted but that''s not so much an issue at this pov and perspective. However, I do see a big problem with contrast in the foreground grass. A quick curves or contrast adjustment in post could fix that, then you''d have a more interesting lead in.', '2008-11-09 16:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053907, 735585, 45475, '<td valign="top">Fun entry. I like the subject and colour here, but I have to say, I''m not liking the blend mode used for the vignette. It''s done something weird to the bg tree and sky.</td>', 'Fun entry. I like the subject and colour here, but I have to say, I''m not liking the blend mode used for the vignette. It''s done something weird to the bg tree and sky.', '2008-11-09 16:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053927, 735043, 45475, '<td valign="top">Outgrown and left out in the snow :( Not so old and rusted, yet clearly has been left out carelessly [possibly just overnight though, eh? ;)]. Not sure about the downward point of view, looks static but has potential with a bit of dressy editing.</td>', 'Outgrown and left out in the snow :( Not so old and rusted, yet clearly has been left out carelessly [possibly just overnight though, eh? ;)]. Not sure about the downward point of view, looks static but has potential with a bit of dressy editing.', '2008-11-09 16:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053938, 735760, 45475, '<td valign="top">Great subject. May have been worth a try converting to tones so that the blown out bg didn''t look so harsh though.</td>', 'Great subject. May have been worth a try converting to tones so that the blown out bg didn''t look so harsh though.', '2008-11-09 17:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053956, 735745, 45475, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t have known who Binion was unless I googled. Interesting story, thanks.<br/> <br/>Not too keen on the straight up shot here. It certainly meets the challenge but seriously lacks impact though.</td>', 'Wouldn''t have known who Binion was unless I googled. Interesting story, thanks. Not too keen on the straight up shot here. It certainly meets the challenge but seriously lacks impact though.', '2008-11-09 17:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053958, 735840, 45475, '<td valign="top">Cool viewpoint and great lines. I like the way you have made an abstract without losing the form and structure of the boat.</td>', 'Cool viewpoint and great lines. I like the way you have made an abstract without losing the form and structure of the boat.', '2008-11-09 17:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5053959, 735388, 45475, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. The greys look a little muddy, a touch more contrast would have lifted this.</td>', 'Interesting shot. The greys look a little muddy, a touch more contrast would have lifted this.', '2008-11-09 17:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
