(5054762, 735478, 2764, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful,so understated, such subtle colors,   loove how the plywood on the wall looks like a painting hung for display.  I like the way the roof and the grass frame the picture.  I especially like the contrasting textures, so distinctly different on each of the photo''s elements.</td>', 'This is so beautiful,so understated, such subtle colors,   loove how the plywood on the wall looks like a painting hung for display.  I like the way the roof and the grass frame the picture.  I especially like the contrasting textures, so distinctly different on each of the photo''s elements.', '2008-11-10 09:49:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5054765, 735658, 63398, '<td valign="top">I like the dark, brooding lighting as well as the PP work you''ve done with this. I thiunk you got hammered unnecessarily score-wise. With the very receptive comments I''ve gotten on my "Monet-ism", I''m surprise that this didn''t stray up into 6+ range. Voters......</td>', 'I like the dark, brooding lighting as well as the PP work you''ve done with this. I thiunk you got hammered unnecessarily score-wise. With the very receptive comments I''ve gotten on my "Monet-ism", I''m surprise that this didn''t stray up into 6+ range. Voters......', '2008-11-10 09:49:46.000000', NULL, 0),
