(5054769, 735567, 63398, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this was one of the things that really grabbed me......I love the forl;orn look it has with the setting/rising sun as it comes across the side of the house. It''s a beautiful structure gone to dereliction and is a perfect fit for teh challenge. Congrats that this fine score didn''t even make your Top 5! LOL!!!</td>', 'The lighting on this was one of the things that really grabbed me......I love the forl;orn look it has with the setting/rising sun as it comes across the side of the house. It''s a beautiful structure gone to dereliction and is a perfect fit for teh challenge. Congrats that this fine score didn''t even make your Top 5! LOL!!!', '2008-11-10 09:52:29.000000', NULL, 0),
