(5054771, 735888, 63398, '<td valign="top">I have five adopted cats now, my wife is bringing another feral from work home, and I live in an area where people constantly dump them. This little guy looks like a survivor......but that sucks on so many levels. Nicely done.<br/>Beautiful kitten!</td>', 'I have five adopted cats now, my wife is bringing another feral from work home, and I live in an area where people constantly dump them. This little guy looks like a survivor......but that sucks on so many levels. Nicely done.Beautiful kitten!', '2008-11-10 09:55:57.000000', NULL, 0);
