(5054903, 735866, 27373, '<td valign="top">Hey, is that Russia over there? Sorry, couldn''t resist.<br/> <br/>Now for the actual comment.<br/> <br/>Without the title I wouldn''t have guessed this was a boat.  I suspected it was, but I''ve seen some mighty oddly built cabins as well.  I didn''t vote on this challenge, but this would''ve probably ended up with a 7 from me.  I really like the bands of clouds and the bands of color going on in the image.  I wish the boat was a bit brighter, I think it would make it clearer what it was.  Nice choice of title, it''s a way of saying "It''s a boat, you fool.  Without saying It''s a boat you fool."<br/> <br/></td>', 'Hey, is that Russia over there? Sorry, couldn''t resist. Now for the actual comment. Without the title I wouldn''t have guessed this was a boat.  I suspected it was, but I''ve seen some mighty oddly built cabins as well.  I didn''t vote on this challenge, but this would''ve probably ended up with a 7 from me.  I really like the bands of clouds and the bands of color going on in the image.  I wish the boat was a bit brighter, I think it would make it clearer what it was.  Nice choice of title, it''s a way of saying "It''s a boat, you fool.  Without saying It''s a boat you fool." ', '2008-11-10 12:21:33.000000', NULL, 0),
