(5055181, 735832, 27373, '<td valign="top">I like the overall image, nice processing.  But, I am not getting the story here (or at least I am not putting it together).  She is clearly crying, grasping a photo that appears to be a "prom date" kind of shot, and she is wearing a wedding band.  She''s dressed in black, so I am thinking the love of her life has passed away.  Where I think I am getting lost is she appears to be holding a hat.  If it is supposed to be a funeral, the hat doesn''t connect to anything else in the image.  It would be great if she was holding something that connected her to the man in the image.</td>', 'I like the overall image, nice processing.  But, I am not getting the story here (or at least I am not putting it together).  She is clearly crying, grasping a photo that appears to be a "prom date" kind of shot, and she is wearing a wedding band.  She''s dressed in black, so I am thinking the love of her life has passed away.  Where I think I am getting lost is she appears to be holding a hat.  If it is supposed to be a funeral, the hat doesn''t connect to anything else in the image.  It would be great if she was holding something that connected her to the man in the image.', '2008-11-10 15:20:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5055218, 735678, 83464, '<td valign="top">I think that this is a great pic. It has great mood and the lighting is very good. The bright light outside draws you right into the shot and it is a scene that tells a story. Well seen and captured. Supa pic. Regards Heinz</td>', 'I think that this is a great pic. It has great mood and the lighting is very good. The bright light outside draws you right into the shot and it is a scene that tells a story. Well seen and captured. Supa pic. Regards Heinz', '2008-11-10 15:31:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5055280, 735832, 16912, '<td valign="top">Ouch Kurtis, imho this should have scored above a 5.5 and should have been your first 6 score (am sure its not far away). Am guessing many of the voters were wanting to see abandoned buildings rather than people (I gave it a 7). <br/> <br/>I''ve spent much longer looking at this shot than I did during voting and agree with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=27373" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">vxpra</a> that the hat is probably redundant in this shot. I like the surroundings you chose and think your model has done a great job of setting the mood. Whilst the entire scene helps meet the challenge a closer crop of her may have scored better for you - very nice :)</td>', 'Ouch Kurtis, imho this should have scored above a 5.5 and should have been your first 6 score (am sure its not far away). Am guessing many of the voters were wanting to see abandoned buildings rather than people (I gave it a 7).  I''ve spent much longer looking at this shot than I did during voting and agree with  vxpra that the hat is probably redundant in this shot. I like the surroundings you chose and think your model has done a great job of setting the mood. Whilst the entire scene helps meet the challenge a closer crop of her may have scored better for you - very nice :)', '2008-11-10 15:47:10.000000', NULL, 0),
