(5055366, 735684, 97166, '<td valign="top">I''m in love with this shot, but I still only gave it a 5.  It''s kind of hypocritical in a way, having trudged through so many static shots of buildings that have no emotional content whatsoever, but try as I might, I simply couldn''t connect this to abandonment. <br/> <br/>''tis my failure, I suppose.</td>', 'I''m in love with this shot, but I still only gave it a 5.  It''s kind of hypocritical in a way, having trudged through so many static shots of buildings that have no emotional content whatsoever, but try as I might, I simply couldn''t connect this to abandonment.  ''tis my failure, I suppose.', '2008-11-10 16:41:34.000000', NULL, 0),
