(5055426, 736027, 67145, '<td valign="top">you see the most horrific and soul destroying conditions in your travels enzo .. this photograph brings tears to my eyes .. i wonder wot that little girl is going thru day to day and wot her future holds .. the sadness of the human condition could not be better told than in your photographs .. seeing an image such as this makes me appreciate the positives in my own life so much more .. no man is really an island .. we are all responsible for this little girl''s plight .. :)</td>', 'you see the most horrific and soul destroying conditions in your travels enzo .. this photograph brings tears to my eyes .. i wonder wot that little girl is going thru day to day and wot her future holds .. the sadness of the human condition could not be better told than in your photographs .. seeing an image such as this makes me appreciate the positives in my own life so much more .. no man is really an island .. we are all responsible for this little girl''s plight .. :)', '2008-11-10 17:21:05.000000', NULL, 0),
