(5055438, 736097, 86322, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by rinac:</b></div><hr/><i> Was it something I said?<br/> <br/>May have to save my 10 vote for images that aren''t so interesting then. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I am truly sorry, that was an oversight from my part. I actually found your comment very interesting, and I am really grateful that you took the time to make up a story out of my picture. Please accept my apologies.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by rinac: Was it something I said? May have to save my 10 vote for images that aren''t so interesting then.   I am truly sorry, that was an oversight from my part. I actually found your comment very interesting, and I am really grateful that you took the time to make up a story out of my picture. Please accept my apologies.', '2008-11-10 17:31:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5055439, 735888, 67145, '<td valign="top">hey michelle .. your story makes me so sad and the poem made me cry .. i totally agree that if you cant do the time with an animal then dont have one .. they are for life and that''s that .. and how on earth could someone abandon an animal .??. <br/>i try &amp; stop myself from imagining all the horrible things that can happen to animals .. when i walk past a pet shop and see the young animals in the windows waiting to be sold my imagination takes over .. where will they end up .. who will look after them .. we drive into picton and everytime we go past a kennel there''s this dog tied up .. every single time .. i have never passed that kennel when he wasnt there .. how sad is that .. i cant imagine treating an animal like that and thats not bad compared to some experiences pets can have .. i wont go on .. <br/>ps ...  its a gorgeous little kitten and you''ve photographed him to perfection .. he looks scared too .. wonderful processing and wonderful image .. :)<br/></td>', 'hey michelle .. your story makes me so sad and the poem made me cry .. i totally agree that if you cant do the time with an animal then dont have one .. they are for life and that''s that .. and how on earth could someone abandon an animal .??. i try & stop myself from imagining all the horrible things that can happen to animals .. when i walk past a pet shop and see the young animals in the windows waiting to be sold my imagination takes over .. where will they end up .. who will look after them .. we drive into picton and everytime we go past a kennel there''s this dog tied up .. every single time .. i have never passed that kennel when he wasnt there .. how sad is that .. i cant imagine treating an animal like that and thats not bad compared to some experiences pets can have .. i wont go on .. ps ...  its a gorgeous little kitten and you''ve photographed him to perfection .. he looks scared too .. wonderful processing and wonderful image .. :)', '2008-11-10 17:32:06.000000', NULL, 0),
