(5104315, 735156, 52449, '<td valign="top">Jeb,<br/> <br/>I apologize for not getting back to you sooner--I''ve been super busy traveling for business and have barely had time to take leisure photographs.<br/> <br/>Congrats on the ribbon! I guess my tutorial has finally been validated! Woo hoo!<br/> <br/>I plan, starting next week, to begin entering challenges again. There will be a lull in my travels this time of year, so I''ll have some time to go out and shoot.<br/> <br/>Again, congratulations and keep up the great work!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Jeb, I apologize for not getting back to you sooner--I''ve been super busy traveling for business and have barely had time to take leisure photographs. Congrats on the ribbon! I guess my tutorial has finally been validated! Woo hoo! I plan, starting next week, to begin entering challenges again. There will be a lull in my travels this time of year, so I''ll have some time to go out and shoot. Again, congratulations and keep up the great work! ', '2008-12-04 01:16:20.000000', NULL, 0),
