(5204003, 735888, 16230, '<td valign="top">This is very nice. What a gorgeous, dirty, cute little kitty! Nice color and focus. I would have liked to see the tips of the ears.<br/> <br/>It''s a shame when an animal is abandoned like that. We recently adopted an older male cat that somebody left near our house (we live out in the sticks). He''s super affectionate and lovable. I can''t understand how anyone could just leave him out in the woods to die like that. It''s amazing how heartless and cruel some people can be. I think there must be a special place in Hell for people like that.</td>', 'This is very nice. What a gorgeous, dirty, cute little kitty! Nice color and focus. I would have liked to see the tips of the ears. It''s a shame when an animal is abandoned like that. We recently adopted an older male cat that somebody left near our house (we live out in the sticks). He''s super affectionate and lovable. I can''t understand how anyone could just leave him out in the woods to die like that. It''s amazing how heartless and cruel some people can be. I think there must be a special place in Hell for people like that.', '2009-01-19 10:47:21.000000', NULL, 0),
